---
// Words of Budapest — large editorial phrase with interactive hover words
---

<section
  class="relative bg-background py-section"
  aria-labelledby="words-heading"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-landing px-container-x sm:px-8 xl:px-14">
    <p
      class="reveal mb-12 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-muted"
    >
      Words of Budapest
    </p>

    <h2 id="words-heading" class="sr-only">A poem about Budapest</h2>

    <!-- Large editorial phrase split across lines -->
    <div
      class="reveal max-w-4xl"
      aria-label="Budapest is a city of bridges, thermal water, stone, music, winter, and golden evenings."
    >
      <p
        class="font-display text-headline-1 font-bold leading-[1.15] text-foreground sm:text-[clamp(2.5rem,2rem+3vw,4.5rem)]"
      >
        Budapest is a city of
        <span class="inline-block text-foreground/40">bridges,</span>
        <br class="hidden sm:block" />
        <span class="inline-block text-foreground/40">thermal water,</span>
        <span class="inline-block text-foreground/40">stone,</span>
        <br class="hidden sm:block" />
        <span class="inline-block text-foreground/40">music,</span>
        <span class="inline-block text-foreground/40">winter</span>
        <br class="hidden sm:block" />
        and <span class="inline-block text-foreground/40">golden evenings.</span
        >
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Editorial divider -->
    <div
      class="reveal mt-16 h-px w-24 bg-border/30 sm:mt-24"
      aria-hidden="true"
    >
    </div>

    <blockquote class="reveal mt-8 max-w-lg">
      <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Every word names a piece of the city. The bridges connect. The thermal
        water heals. The stone remembers. The music sustains. Winter transforms.
        And the golden evenings — those belong to everyone who has ever stood on
        the Danube embankment and watched the light change.
      </p>
    </blockquote>
  </div>
</section>
